@startuml
' Define actors and participants
actor User
participant LoginScreen
participant AuthDatabase
participant ClientApp
participant ServerApp
participant Protocol
participant QCSDatabase

title QCS Client-Server Collaboration Diagram

== Login Process ==
User -> LoginScreen : 1. enterCredentials()
LoginScreen -> AuthDatabase : 2. validateCredentials()
AuthDatabase --> LoginScreen : 3. returnLoginResult()
LoginScreen -> ClientApp : 4. launchClient()

== Client/Server Communication ==
ClientApp -> ServerApp : 5. connect(port, user)
ClientApp -> Protocol : 6. encode("send circuit")
Protocol -> ServerApp : 7. send(encodedMsg)
ServerApp -> Protocol : 8. decodeMessage()
ServerApp -> QCSDatabase : 9. storeCircuit()
ServerApp -> Protocol : 10. encode("ack")
Protocol -> ClientApp : 11. response("ack")

ClientApp -> Protocol : 12. encode("get circuit")
Protocol -> ServerApp : 13. sendRequest()
ServerApp -> QCSDatabase : 14. fetchCircuit()
QCSDatabase -> ServerApp : 15. returnCircuit()
ServerApp -> Protocol : 16. encode(circuit)
Protocol -> ClientApp : 17. deliver(circuit)

@enduml
